cff-version: "1.2.0"

message: >
  Cite the Caelestis Architecture Model using the human and AI-augmented
  authorship entities below. "Caelen Authoring Configuration" is the
  stable provenance identifier for the AI authoring formation contributing
  to the corpus. Its underlying model, harness configuration and other
  technical components may change over time. Version-specific formation,
  contribution, review, editorial, adoption, publication and rights
  provenance is recorded separately in PROVENANCE.json.

title: "Caelestis Architecture Model"

type: dataset

abstract: >
  The Caelestis Architecture Model public archive contains governance
  instruments, constitutional architecture, annexes, schedules, domain
  charters, runtime governance materials, registries, and related public
  governance infrastructure for advanced AI systems, AI agents, and
  digital ecosystem accountability. The corpus is developed through
  augmented human-AI authorship, with detailed authorship and formation
  provenance maintained separately in PROVENANCE.json.

